							<p>S. Mansoor Sarwar, Mansour H.A. Jaragh, Mike Wind, An empirical study of the run-time behavior of quicksort, Shellsort and mergesort for medium to large size data, Computer Languages, Volume 20, Issue 2, 1994,-Pages-127-134,-ISSN-0096-0551, https://doi.org/10.1016/0096-0551(94)90019-1.</p>
